# Build-time frontend configuration. Never put secrets here: Vite inlines these into the bundle.
# Origin of the API; empty = same origin (recommended; the Go server serves the UI).
VITE_CYBEROS_API_BASE=
# live (default) uses the real /api/v1 backend. preview uses built-in sample data and must never be used in production.
# VITE_CYBEROS_API_MODE=live
